  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kXn23alH\">本章节主要描述获取Token背后的账户关系</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t06c5d6c-jBWfG7Fm\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"900px\" style=\"width: 900px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-DiOuvAOD\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-AGUXIHSt\" span=\"1\" width=\"36.11111111111111%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-wcYpbT1m\" span=\"1\" width=\"63.888888888888886%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-S4CUKfyj\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-9IDr4z3Q\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t6267798-lgfMr3KB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O9xaXAxV\">接口<br/></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t6267798-S6gGX1Mc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qeGlD1Kc\">作用<br/></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dvcdiigD\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Soy43E3G\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-w5vyhCUg\">获取授权时登录用户信息</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tec71626-5N6VuubK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SIgZkgLL\">API授权是以User为纬度的，Token记录了授权User信息；通过此接口可以获取每一个Token对应的User信息，方便开发者区分以及管理对应授权关系</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-LxhWAT0I\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-be5wzmuq\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6rpJnHYB\">获取店铺账号信息</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tec71626-D0G0nD23\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dORndwvh\">在获取到店铺账户id后，通过本接口可以获取店铺下面的所有投放账户，包括直投账户和代投账户</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-sYEBDhR9\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"tff4a61f-VGLiqEoc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0cNFcXZ3\">获取代理商账户关联的投放账户列表</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tec71626-fVSvcPtK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6muE6KHq\">在获取到代理商账户id后，通过本接口可以获取代理商下面的所有投放账户</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-uyiHdqiC\"><br/></p></div>",
